Package: statscraft
Version: @VERSION@
Section: science
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: libxkbcommon0, libwayland-client0 | libwayland-client, libx11-6, libxcursor1, libxrandr2, libxi6, libgl1, fontconfig
Maintainer: The StatsCraft Garage <saurav.sarma@example.com>
Description: Lightweight statistical workbench
 StatsCraft is a native statistical analysis workstation inspired by the
 classic statistics workflow: spreadsheet data editor with Data/Variable
 views, procedure dialogs that generate syntax, pivot-table output viewer,
 charts, and a command-syntax interface.
Homepage: https://github.com/SarmaSaurav/statscraft
